pport for expected AmxBans RBS update (ban by ASN))\n* Added cvar 'bg_ipapi_use_for_ext_as'\n* Optimized logic of func_GetCheckID() function", "created_at": "2024-10-12T13:57:39Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f8687319b04182c789ca52c7c025057ea4ffa222", "message": "IPHub-Client 1.4\n\n* Added support for new main plugin functionality (support for expected AmxBans RBS update (ban by ASN))\n* Added cvar 'bg_iphubclient_use_for_ext_as'", "created_at": "2024-10-12T13:20:38Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2b29dee782bfba19ce485bbf89d1c836846df0c7", "message": "IPHub Curl 0.9\n\n* Added support for new main plugin functionality (support for expected AmxBans RBS update (ban by ASN))\n* Added cvar 'bg_iphub_use_for_ext_as'", "created_at": "2024-10-12T13:19:49Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8a985515ac153d1027eb50406bc3b5ce511a0528", "message": "IPHub 0.9\n\n* Added support for new main plugin functionality (support for expected AmxBans RBS update (ban by ASN))\n* Added cvar 'bg_iphub_use_for_ext_as'\n* Optimized logic of func_GetCheckID() function", "created_at": "2024-10-12T13:09:28Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ceb19a37d53b3dbb5f5be7d78f63b549ce93a872", "message": "EXT AS Info Test 1.0\n\nPlugin for testing new functionality of main plugin v1.1.14 (support for expected AmxBans RBS update (ban by ASN))", "created_at": "2024-10-12T13:05:41Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9494aac656847594e5f8f9e62530744a91b1197f", "message": "Update bypass_guard.inc", "created_at": "2024-10-12T12:58:50Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "448e5659bf452638d8b4534924adde6d6206063d", "message": "Bypass Guard 1.1.14\n\n* Added support for the expected AmxBans RBS update (ban by ASN)\n* Added native BypassGuard_RequestExtAsInfo\n* Added native BypassGuard_SendExtAsInfo\n* Added forward BypassGuard_FwdToExtAsInfoProvider\n* Added forward BypassGuard_AnnounceExtAsInfo", "created_at": "2024-10-12T12:58:17Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "701193f5a7415f8a3108fa641e758c20310b0dfa", "message": "Move amxx modules to their own folder", "created_at": "2024-10-12T12:53:25Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c1ca8a59699d41e18f611b2c7a231ac7518ef05c", "message": "Upload curl & grip modules", "created_at": "2024-10-12T12:52:06Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "07d036ab4d73c32b4d398f5b38f385a11f5e7e38", "message": "Create README.md", "created_at": "2024-09-13T12:33:04Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "528bd69643894b461e4d2c7648a2aaa196dd11e9", "message": "Supervisor 0.6\n\nFix broken feature with \"sql.cfg\" value for bg_sv_sql_host cvar (thanks to SKAJIbnEJIb)", "created_at": "2024-09-06T16:55:00Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f5b854c6ee9d2e2a13958499db6090c345de09d5", "message": "Update bypass_guard.sma\n\nAdd credits", "created_at": "2024-08-23T18:03:24Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a8036b7e1a734fb3b2f2e207295faf6af909a09c", "message": "Merge pull request #1 from Giferns/new-feats\n\nNew feats", "created_at": "2024-08-23T17:46:12Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9bacb6566cdb35455b8b8e5db4845e6136d31bea", "message": "Supervisor 0.5\n\n* Compatibility with new functionality of the core version 1.0.10 has been implemented\n* The bByWhitepass and bStrictStatus arguments have been added to the BypassGuard_SendSupervisingResult native\n* The ability to load DB connection settings from amxmodx/sql.cfg has been added, for this the value of the cvar\nbg_sv_sql_host must be changed to \"sql.cfg\" (idea by SKAJIbnEJIb)\n* Cleaning of obsolete records in tables has been added, once per server startup session (idea by SKAJIbnEJIb)\n* The bg_sv_min_ban_time cvar has been added to support the new expected version of AMXBans RBS, the author\npromised to release an update with a larger number of arguments in the amxbans_ban_pre() forward", "created_at": "2024-08-23T17:43:43Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b6f8ef687962b9706719cb789ce2c714a2caad9d", "message": "Bypass Guard 1.0.10\n\n* Added the ability to check a player on Proxy/VPN only if Supervisor has an active block,\nand the player being checked does not have a whitepass (i.e. the player is recognized by the server as 'new') (idea by SKAJIbnEJIb).\n* Added mode \"2\" to bypass_guard_check_proxy cvar\n* Added arguments bByWhitepass and bStrictStatus to BypassGuard_SendSupervisingResult native\n* Changed the logic order, now the request to the supervisor is sent before checking on Proxy/VPN\n* Added the ability to skip checking players who, according to statistics, spent # or more minutes on the server (idea by SKAJIbnEJIb).\n* Added bypass_guard_allow_by_stats cvar\n* Added bypass_guard_stats_type cvar\n* bypass_guard.inc: ALLOW_TYPE__STATS_IMMUNITY element added to ALLOW_TYPE_ENUM enumeration", "created_at": "2024-08-23T17:41:57Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9dc92115524f7ec70fcc9e2343bffb046470ae9b", "message": "Supervisor 0.4", "created_at": "2024-02-13T08:27:13Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f36a0a5264660a36cac833871f736d3b47b610cb", "message": "Update bg_supervisor.sma\n\nFix possible bug \"#1067 - Incorrect default value for 'until_global'\"\nThanks to D1esel (https://dev-cs.ru/threads/31880/post-169242)", "created_at": "2024-02-13T08:26:50Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "252167a2d8f95a4815bd96c0b294c2211d3d8ff2", "message": "Bypass Guard 1.0.9\n\n* Added forced conversion of the country code to uppercase in the native BypassGuard_RequestGeoData(),\nsince iphub.info began to periodically return the country code in lower case, which breaks the verification logic\n* Added cvar 'bypass_guard_check_proxy', which allows you to disable checking for Proxy/VPN. Added for servers from\nRussia, because Ukrainian players sometimes cannot access servers in the Russian Federation directly, and use Proxy/VPN for this.\nIt is not recommended to disable the Proxy/VPN check just like that, this greatly weakens the protection against ban bypass!", "created_at": "2024-02-11T13:04:12Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bc1540e5f281d104ec134592c082fbe8955f3d96", "message": "Supervisor 0.3", "created_at": "2024-02-04T05:41:47Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c21f06612ecbc5969bc69bf56949e7fd78e045a2", "message": "Update bg_supervisor.sma\n\nChange default values for cvars 'bg_sv_bans_exp_time_global' & 'bg_sv_restrict_duration_global'", "created_at": "2024-02-04T05:38:47Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "15ef356176171eeec036e7d31dde549522985691", "message": "Update bg_supervisor.sma\n\nAdded support for accounting bans for 'Diveban X Open'", "created_at": "2024-02-04T05:27:36Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "411f68020fddaab31c4c8d02dd1cfc0f854c02ed", "message": "Update bg_supervisor.sma\n\nImprove timediff calculation", "created_at": "2024-02-04T05:12:23Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2992f2479cfc014c0c9e494c224c6f286fbfaa3d", "message": "Update bg_supervisor.sma", "created_at": "2023-07-21T20:37:21Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "87a6d960518abd78f8983b4c6ae06922bdd15723", "message": "Update bg_supervisor.sma", "created_at": "2023-07-21T18:42:28Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dd1d229458f0e3183dbf99ee876f4156eb58415a", "message": "Supervisor 0.2\n\nAdded support for accounting bans for '[fork] Lite Bans' (support for cvars 'bg_sv_ignore_server_bans' and 'bg_sv_min_ban_time')", "created_at": "2023-07-21T18:37:44Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a2c2570c510efbae7f95f7f71d7ade36aea1af3e", "message": "Move unsupported sxgeo provider", "created_at": "2023-07-21T16:23:01Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3cb9061960dd09682c0b36c219dab3236bf365bb", "message": "Update bg_provider_geoip.sma", "created_at": "2023-07-21T14:56:06Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4041a3feeffed0d0800675acea4fb5010711fa66", "message": "Version fix", "created_at": "2023-07-21T14:15:20Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7e4882ef578da116da706b89afcf3c062fdf4a9a", "message": "Update bypass_guard.sma", "created_at": "2023-07-21T13:11:39Z", "repo": "BypassGuard", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5fdd04b81c0b5e38a15bbe8b8f589ba75fd95f80", "mes